1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,452
Jack: We need to get in and out, no more than 10 minutes.

2
00:00:02,652 --> 00:00:05,104
Sarah: I've got the security codes, but we still need to disable the cameras.

3
00:00:05,304 --> 00:00:07,804
Sarah: Are you sure this is the right time? The streets are still crowded.

4
00:00:08,004 --> 00:00:10,504
Jack: It's the perfect distraction. No one will notice us in this chaos.

5
00:00:10,704 --> 00:00:13,288
Jack: Now, let's get to work. We have 5 minutes before the guards make their rounds.

6
00:00:13,488 --> 00:00:16,072
Sarah: I've got the display case open. Let's move, let's move!
